  "main_text": "ABOUT GARVEE\nYour next\nbest partner\n.\nFor the home you make.\nThe work you do. The possibilities ahead.\nGet to know us\n↓\nHOME · WORK · EVERYDAY POSSIBILITIES\nMade for what’s next.\nOUR STORY\nBig possibilities.\nEveryday value.\n10+\nyears serving the needs of homes, projects and growing businesses.\nA more comfortable home. A project brought to life. A business ready for its next step.\nFor over a decade, GARVEE has brought together practical products for families and businesses—from furniture and toys to automotive tools and commercial equipment.\nOur purpose is simple: make quality and choice more accessible, so you can get on with what matters.\n01\nUseful in real life\nSolutions selected around the way people live, build and work.\n02\nValue with standards\nThoughtful quality and practical pricing can belong together.\n03\nBetter by listening\nCustomer feedback keeps shaping what comes next.\nEVERYDAY NEEDS\nComfort for home.\nAdventure for family.\nGARVEE grows with the routines that matter—from keeping daily spaces comfortable to giving young explorers room to move.\nHOME COMFORT\n01 / AIR CONDITIONING\nCool comfort, made simple.\nPractical cooling solutions for bedrooms, living spaces and everyday routines.\nExplore air conditioners\n↗\nOUTDOOR ADVENTURE\n02 / RIDE-ON TOYS\nBig adventures, right-sized.\nElectric ride-on cars and UTVs that turn driveways and backyards into places to explore.\nExplore ride-on toys\n↗\nA PARTNER IN YOUR EVERYDAY\nAt home. At work.\nRight there with you.\nFrom everyday comfort and play to the projects that move life forward, GARVEE brings practical choice to every part of the day.\nTHE SPACES YOU MAKE YOUR OWN\n01 / FOR YOUR HOME\nMore room\nfor everyday living.\nFrom a welcoming backyard to a room that feels like you, discover practical ways to make home more comfortable—and your next project more possible.\nFind your next idea\n↗\nTHE WORK THAT MOVES YOU FORWARD\n02 / FOR YOUR WORK\nFor the hands\nthat make it happen.\nEquip your workshop, kitchen or growing business with tools and everyday essentials, all in one place.\nPower & hand tools\n↗\nRestaurant & food service\n↗\nAutomotive\n↗\nTHE GARVEE PROMISE\nGood value.\nBuilt on good principles.\nClose supplier relationships and customer feedback help us keep improving what matters.\n01\nQuality that matters\nPractical products, thoughtfully selected.\n02\nPrices within reach\nMore value for your everyday budget.\n03\nChoice for your needs\nFrom home essentials to business equipment.\n04\nAlways improving\nYour feedback shapes what comes next.\nHERE TO HELP\nConfidence, beyond the purchase.\nDelivery made clear\nShipping estimates and destination details.\nShipping policy\n↗\n30-day returns\nSee return eligibility and conditions.\nReturn policy\n↗\nWarranty support\nFind the coverage for your product.\nWarranty policy\n↗\nA helping hand\nGet in touch with our support team.\nContact us\n↗\nLOOKING AHEAD\nWhatever comes next,\nlet’s make it possible.\nWe’re building a destination that grows with your needs.\nFor life, for work, and for your next idea.\nExplore GARVEE\n↗\nYOUR NEXT BEST PARTNER."
